hich window has focus based on the one that has the glowing outline:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d6abd08-1910-4ce1-bf23-cd2b9172b0c9\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Set a breakpoint that will get hit multiple times\n- Run the game\n- Watch as the breakpoint triggers, but the editor window does not grab focus\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122666/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122666/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}